                                "sense_id": "4ec04a44-bc81-3c3d-8d72-1c649c0e06c9",
                                "text": "The abundance of these proteins in the independent ovary section dataset were assessed using linear mixed models to compare abundance in ovary sections (four levels: germarium, early vitellariums, late vitellarium, and germarium)."
